# .well-known passthrough
#
# Drop provider verification files here (e.g. Brave, Mastodon, or any
# service that asks you to serve a file under /.well-known/). Everything
# in public/ is copied to the site root at build time, so a file placed
# here is served at https://<domain>/.well-known/<filename>.
#
# Meta-tag verification (Google Search Console, Bing Webmaster) is
# handled via GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION / BING_SITE_VERIFICATION in
# src/config.ts instead.
